  [[Model-2.mdpuml Model-2]], [[Model-10.mdpuml Model-10]], [[Model-11.mdpuml Model-11]]
  [[Model-12.mdpuml Model-12]], [[Model-13.mdpuml Model-13]]
end note
rectangle "Модель, наборы и группы" as Area_3 <<область>>
note right of Area_3
  [[Model-3.mdpuml Model-3]], [[Model-14.mdpuml Model-14]], [[Model-15.mdpuml Model-15]]
