T_Model_Model_ModelData -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_Interfaces_IObjectsData
T_Model_Model_Interfaces_IObjectsData -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_ObjectsData
T_Model_Model_ObjectsData -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_Interfaces_IGroupData
T_Model_Model_Interfaces_IGroupData -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_GroupsData_GroupData
T_Model_Model_GroupsData_GroupData -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_Interfaces_ObjectsCollections_IObjectsSet_1
T_Model_Model_Interfaces_ObjectsCollections_IObjectsSet_1 -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_ObjectsCollections_ObjectsSet_1
T_Model_Model_ObjectsCollections_ObjectsSet_1 -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_Interfaces_ObjectsCollections_IObjectsCollection_1
T_Model_Model_Interfaces_ObjectsCollections_IObjectsCollection_1 -[hidden]down-> T_Model_Model_ObjectsCollections_ObjectsCollection_1
T_Model_Model_ObjectsCollections_ObjectsCollection_1 -[hidden]down-> Area_1
Area_1 -[hidden]down-> Area_2
Area_2 -[hidden]down-> Area_3
Area_3 -[hidden]down-> Area_4
legend bottom
  Подробности: нажмите имя поддиаграммы в примечании.
